{"id":"8072450637898","handle":"tie-up-chiffon-ruffle-sleeve-bridesmaid-dress-es02659","title":"ever AMIRA|Tie-Up Chiffon Ruffle Sleeve Bridesmaid Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>This dress is built for the “all-day wedding” schedule—photos, ceremony, cocktails, dancing—without feeling fussy. The V neck front keeps the look clean and flattering, while flutter sleeves add soft arm coverage that still feels light. A defined waist and flowing A line skirt create an easy silhouette that moves beautifully when you walk. The side slit adds comfort (and a little drama in motion).</p>\n<p>The standout detail is the back: a lace-trimmed open back with a lace up corset-style design that adjusts for a more personalized fit. And yes—there are pockets, which is exactly what bridesmaids and wedding guests appreciate when you don’t want to carry a bag all night.</p>\n<article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Best for</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bridesmaids and mix and match bridal parties</li>\n<li>Garden and outdoor ceremonies</li>\n<li>Beach and destination weddings</li>\n<li>Formal wedding guest outfits and evening receptions</li>\n<li>Engagement photos rehearsal dinners and bridal showers</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: Floor-length.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Short sleeves.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Back zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: It is not padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises chiffon.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is non-stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Bridesmaid Dresses","tags":["3days","A-Line","Apple","Backless","clearance","Fall","Floor-Length","Green","Hourglass","Inverted","measure","Pear","Pocket","Rectangular","Ribbon Detail","Ruffle Sleeve","Short Sleeves","Spring","Statement Back","Strapless","Summ